<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Order Status Update</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background: #f4f6f9; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #333; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #1a1a2e; color: #fff; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; }
    .header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .body { padding: 36px 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .status-box { background: #f0fdf4; border: 2px solid #22c55e; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .status-box .status-label { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #16a34a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .status-box .status-msg { font-size: 14px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6; }
    .ref-row { background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .ref-row p:first-child { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #aaa; }
    .ref-row p:last-child { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .footer { background: #f8f9fa; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding: 24px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #999; line-height: 1.8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>⚡ Njiani Electricals</h1>
      <p>Order Status Update</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <p class="greeting">Hello {{customerName}},</p>

      <div class="ref-row">
        <p>Order Reference</p>
        <p>{{referenceNumber}}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="status-box">
        <div class="status-label">{{statusLabel}}</div>
        <div class="status-msg">{{statusMessage}}</div>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666; line-height: 1.6;">
        If you have any questions about your order, please don't hesitate to contact us.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        📞 <strong>+254 746 079 183</strong> &nbsp;|&nbsp; ✉️ <strong>orders@njiani.co.ke</strong>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top:10px">&copy; 2024 Njiani Electricals Limited. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
